# Guiding Center 4d Barely Trapped with Gauss-Legendre VPRK Methods and Projections

The time step and number of time steps are those of this orbit, set in
`src/guiding-center-4d.jl`; the toroidal momentum is shown alongside the energy, as the
second invariant of the guiding centre dynamics.

```julia
run_list(iodeproblem(), "Guiding Center 4d Barely Trapped", tableaus_vprk_gauss())
```
